2. MODIFICATIONS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a re-implementation of the watch client, written from
scratch in JavaScript for the ACE-Lite (Lite Wearable) runtime.  It does not
contain the upstream Android (Kotlin / Jetpack Compose) source code.  The major
modifications relative to the upstream project are:

  - the entire watch client: single-page canvas rendering, internal view state
    machine, hand-written animation, crown handling, i18n and icon packing
  - a read-only watch UI: adding, editing and deleting courses is intentionally
    not possible on the watch
  - memory-bounded synchronization: only the current week is retained
  - removal of the Wear Engine dependency

As required by AGPL-3.0 section 5(a), the modified source is stated here and the
files carry no misleading authorship claims.

